{"title":"Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Specimen papers for <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial\" title=\"2006 Cyprus Seniors Provincial\">2006 Cyprus Seniors Provincial competition</a></b> problems and solutions. There are different papers according to the grade. Click on each one one to find the problems and solution of each paper.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/1st_grade\" title=\"Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial/1st grade\">1st grade</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade\" title=\"Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial/2nd grade\">2nd grade</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/3rd_grade\" title=\"Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial/3rd grade\">3rd grade</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<hr />\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial\" title=\"2006 Cyprus Seniors Provincial\">2006 competition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Cyprus Seniors Provincial Problems and Solutions\">Back to the List</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial_competition\" title=\"Cyprus Seniors Provincial competition\">Cyprus Seniors Provincial competition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Cyprus Seniors Provincial Problems and Solutions\">Cyprus Seniors Provincial Probl